{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"尼日利亚","country_iso":"NGA","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:02:49.348487","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"NGA-HB-0008","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"尼日利亚3MTPA FLNG和230MW Power Barge项目","project_name_en":"Nigeria 3MTPA FLNG and 230MW Power Barge Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"惠生海工","content":"惠生清洁能源科技集团股份有限公司（以下简称“惠生清洁能源”）宣布，与Ace Gas & FLNG（以下简称“Ace”）正式签署了计划在尼日利亚部署的3MTPA FLNG和230MW Power Barge项目FEED合同。\n惠生清洁能源已于2024年初成功完成该项目的Pre-FEED阶段。该项目旨在开发产能约300万吨的FLNG，计划部署在离岸10公里，水深约20米的海域，每日接收并处理约5亿标准立方英尺的天然气。天然气的液化过程将采用CHART公司的IPSMR技术，这一成熟解决方案将确保项目的高效运行。\n此外，一部分天然气将从FLNG输送至230MW的power barge，用于为Ace Gas & FLNG公司在Escravos和Forcados区域运营的气体资产及气体处理设施提供稳定的电力支持。\n此次FEED研究将极大地简化项目开发流程，提供项目技术和经济可行性的全面概览，为下一阶段的EPCIC奠定坚实基础。未来，惠生将一如既往的持续与合同伙伴紧密协作，坚持高效、安全、高质量地为客户提供定制化的项目服务，推动清洁能源的可持续发展。","content_sha256":"4c5497b6cc4955cfd86542df977d6f59564afc2d61243d3627b19573c582adf1","id":5388,"publish_date":"2024-12-19 19:50:14","title":"惠生清洁能源签订尼日利亚FLNG和Power Barge项目FEED合同","title_sha256":"a09ef0a4b3f437ff74b6fce4539d69ec01d13656efe3281b9bafadb7155e3e12","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/76424.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"NGA-HB-0008","capacity_details":"FLNG: 3MTPA, Power Barge: 230MW","capacity_mw":230.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"230","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:02:49.348613","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"NGA-HB-0008-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.wison.com/read_page/884\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"productio